# PDF Export — Puppeteer / Chromium path override (required on Render free tier):
# On Render, add a build command to install Chromium:
#   apt-get install -y chromium-browser  (if using a custom Docker/buildpack)
#   OR: PUPPETEER_SKIP_CHROMIUM_DOWNLOAD=true and install google-chrome-stable
# Then set this env var to the installed path, e.g.:
# PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=/usr/bin/chromium-browser
# If unset, Puppeteer will try its bundled binary (works locally, may fail on Render).
# PUPPETEER_EXECUTABLE_PATH=
